{
  "text": " I stole some sweets and a can of pop from his local shop, and they call her parents. My friend's mum arrives, she's got bleached blonde hair and pink skin and this American accent. And I'm the devil in her light blue eyes. Her shoulder length hair is waving around, she's not happy. There's fury in her eyes, and all aimed at me. She screams at me. The shop assistant is satisfied, at least one of us got what she deserved. Then my mum arrives, she never really shouted at anyone, she's not gonna start now. Did she ever feel angry? She said Sophie's mum's shouting was enough and we can go home now. We walk home hand in hand, and I feel sorry for the shopkeeper, but my mum didn't shout too. That's the last time we shoplifted this shop.",
